swer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390175} {:answer/id #uuid "088fb8e1-80c8-5b96-9fd5-7e059d4a9db8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390176}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186390176} :answer-field/id #uuid "a223d6ba-7747-5202-9cbc-db253e2e4893" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390171}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "55adfa30-bde9-5dd7-8854-b990477f8d63" :question/math-academy-id "q-183325" :question/problem "Describe the set $S={5,6,7,...,50}$ using a conditional definition.\n\n$$\nS={x\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,{{field-2}}\\le x\\le {{field-3}}}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The set $S$ contains all natural numbers between $5$ and $50$ (including $5$ and $50$).\n\nTherefore, the set can be written as\n\n$$\nS={x\\in N\\,:\\,5\\le x\\le 50}.\n$$\n\n**Note**: This definition is not unique. For example:\n\n- We can write $x\\in Z.$ This gives\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,5\\le x\\le 50}.\n$$\n\n- We can write $4<x<51.$ This gives\n\n$$\nS={x\\in N\\,:\\,4<x<51},\n$$\n\nor, writing $x\\in Z$ as before, we have\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,4<x<51}.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "8aac6117-dcf7-586f-a196-0f59c7458408" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418461}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418463 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412792 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8def1d3c-eb5a-566b-af12-d3ce42da3e13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412787} {:answer/id #uuid "9c500ffe-51a8-5905-8476-0b724f9d7bf5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412788} {:answer/id #uuid "f774e7f6-8dc4-55a7-a225-c1111386f024" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412789}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412787} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b480447-2056-5cc5-bd5d-e625edb62fa3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412790} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c80075a-23bd-565b-b792-75b9483248b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412783} {:answer/id #uuid "1fec48bf-7341-5e00-bf54-1e2e3c7d845f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "N" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412784} {:answer/id #uuid "2ff79e69-0b12-56e7-9984-59ab4023180c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "Z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412785} {:answer/id #uuid "3b1ceaab-4f04-5722-81a1-b363e51746d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412786}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412785} :answer-field/id #uuid "ddcd27c7-8319-5553-8fa5-9d996008549a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412791}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "1e8c26e7-e9d8-563e-b578-6100bf923d6c" :question/math-academy-id "q-183697" :question/problem "Describe the set $S={…,-2,-1,0,1,2,3}$ using a conditional definition.\n\n$$\nS={x\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,x<{{field-2}}}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The set $S$ contains all integers less than $3,$ including $3.$\n\nIn other words, $S$ contains all integers less than $4,$  *excluding* $4.$ \n\nTherefore, the set can be written as\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,x<4}.\n$$\n\n**Note**: This definition is not unique. For example:\n\n- We can write $x\\le 3.$ This gives\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,x\\le 3}.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "97d9e6fc-8a81-5514-9e30-4a41f4e00265" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418464}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418464 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287857 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bcff3a1a-a2f3-5bdb-ac79-6dd44d5cc596" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "45" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286512}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186286512} :answer-field/id #uuid "1d58c939-488c-5ba6-9cbb-2a5e7499c7be" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287212} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a5f4dcf-8fe9-57f1-adc1-722c8f879243" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286202}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186286202} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e85f64d-db61-5514-b2c7-a9a8b11f7190" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287214} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5fdec9f3-318f-51f1-85f9-84a5f248750f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285667}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186285667} :answer-field/id #uuid "8eb3f8c2-6388-5345-9c70-eb27eeba4550" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287442}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "250dc34e-ac8d-50ac-8f72-1123fa8a7b34" :question/math-academy-id "q-183751" :question/problem "Find the missing coefficients in the conditional definition of the set ${-3,-\\sqrt{5},\\sqrt{5}}$ given below.\n\n${-3,-\\sqrt{5},\\sqrt{5}}={x\\in R\\,:\\,3{x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}\n$x\\,-$\n{{field-3}}\n$=0}$" :question/worked-solution "The given set contains the roots $x\\in R$ of some cubic polynomial $p(x).$\n\nSince the cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-3,$ ${x}_{2}=-\\sqrt{5},$ and ${x}_{3}=\\sqrt{5},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =(3)(x-(-3))(x-(-\\sqrt{5}))(x-\\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =3(x+3)(x+\\sqrt{5})(x-\\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =3(x+3)({x}^{2}-\\sqrt{5}x+\\sqrt{5}x-(\\sqrt{5})^{2}) \\\\  & =3(x+3)({x}^{2}-5) \\\\  & =3({x}^{3}-5x+3{x}^{2}-15) \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}+9{x}^{2}-15x-45\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the given set as\n\n$$\n{-3,-\\sqrt{5},\\sqrt{5}}={x\\in R\\,:\\,3{x}^{3}+9{x}^{2}-15x-45=0}.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "a5125736-78d1-5780-b300-7ef91791e033"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186418465 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186396254 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b665804-beaa-5388-ac25-9397d16709cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396256} {:answer/id #uuid "cc29d216-b4b5-5d05-aee8-fa1d64f964da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396257} {:answer/id #uuid "80b0d143-f228-52ab-ad57-54619241a5e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "Z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396258} {:answer/id #uuid "20f47bfb-da3d-5440-aa25-5e8189b5f62d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396259}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186396258} :answer-field/id #uuid "474b1fda-a88a-5ba4-9077-194e8d8272f7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396255} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c59aee3-d837-5b8a-89d8-81c0f7ee8818" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396261} {:answer/id #uuid "684cccbb-1991-5da7-b5d8-ae5038ca20fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396262} {:answer/id #uuid "49d7bea2-4454-50f8-a312-a7dbeb88e4b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396263} {:answer/id #uuid "e7ad40d6-b7cd-5b85-a266-6846ebb70f82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396264} 